 Issuer: ARCH CAPITAL GROUP LTD (ACGL)\nRoadshow: URL: https://dealroadshow
 .com | Password: ACGL2026 | Direct Link: https://dealroadshow.com/e/ACGL20
 26\n\nDeal context:\nArch Capital Group Ltd. (ACGL)\, a Bermuda-based insu
 rance\, reinsurance\, and mortgage insurance holding company with approxim
 ately $26.9 billion in capital\, has mandated Wells Fargo Securities\, Bof
 A Securities\, J.P. Morgan\, and Lloyds Securities to arrange fixed income
  investor calls on June 1\, 2026\, ahead of a potential SEC-registered sen
 ior unsecured notes offering. The deal is at the Mandate stage\, with no s
 ize\, tenor\, pricing\, or ratings disclosed\, and is subject to market co
 nditions. Wells Fargo Securities is coordinating logistics for three inves
 tor calls scheduled throughout the afternoon of June 1\, 2026.
